%%%
authors := ["Andrew V. Sutherland", "FormalFrontier"]
%%%

This website presents the lecture notes from Andrew V. Sutherland's
MIT 18.785 _Number Theory I_ (Fall 2021) alongside their formalization
in Lean 4 using Mathlib.

The lecture text is from
[Sutherland's 18.785 lecture notes](https://math.mit.edu/classes/18.785/2025/lectures.html),
used with the author's coordination, under the
[Creative Commons BY-NC-SA 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/) license.
The Lean formalizations were produced by [FormalFrontier](https://github.com/FormalFrontier)
and are available under the [Apache 2.0](https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0) license.

The formalization source is
[FormalFrontier/Sutherland-NumberTheory-Lecture1-draft2](https://github.com/FormalFrontier/Sutherland-NumberTheory-Lecture1-draft2),
synced to commit `8b41040af45ebe15e2f1a709205608d906b28175`.

{include 0 SutherlandNumberTheory.Lecture1}
